I end the call with my parents.
The room is quiet now.
I stand up and go to my suitcase.
The suitcase is very big and heavy.
I open the suitcase on the floor.
What do I need for the first night?
I look for my pyjamas and my toothbrush.
Then I take my laptop out of the bag.
I put the laptop on the small table.
I put my mobile phone next to it.
There is also a wardrobe here.
I take my winter coat.
It is very thick and heavy.
I hang the coat in the wardrobe.
Now I am ready for the night.
I sit down on the bed.
I take a deep breath.
I am finally in Berlin.
Tomorrow I will see the city for the first time by day.
My new life begins here.
